<title>CROATIA: Croatia June unemployment falls to 16.5 vs 16.8 pc.</title>
<headline>Croatia June unemployment falls to 16.5 vs 16.8 pc.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Statistics Bureau issued the following unemployment details.</p>
<p>    CROATIA UNEMPLOYMENT	 JUNE 97    MAY 97     JUNE 96</p>
<p>    Total unemployed	     267,746   274,521    252,524</p>
<p>    Unemployment rate (pct)     16.5     16.8(16.3)  17.9</p>
<p>NOTES -- The rate for May has been revised (old figure in brackets). Data exclude unemployed in Serb region of Eastern Slavonia. The unemployment rate fell to less than 16 percent in September 1996 after army, police and farmers were included in total workforce, but joblessness has increased since then. -- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-14557075</p>
</text>
